        "id": "thm-irreducibly-weakly-diagonally-dominant-jacobi-and-gauss-seidel-converge",
        "kind": "theorem",
        "title": "Irreducibly weak row diagonal dominance with a strict row guarantees Jacobi and Gauss–Seidel convergence",
        "deps": [
